# SPEC: 44_8_prefab_static,44_8_vocab
# Negative test: a prefab child name shorter than 5 characters.  Prefab and
# child names are the UI's cross-file wiring vocabulary (spawn:/set_text/
# child_clicked address them by name), so they must be >=5 chars — stricter
# than the 3-char identifier floor.  See spec/44_8_prefab_static.md.
#
# Expected exit code: 1
#
# Diagnostic-Form:
#   ...: prefab child name 'bg' is shorter than 5 characters — prefab and child
#   names are referenced by name across files; pick a descriptive name (>=5 chars)

- prefab:
    name: PanelBox
    width: 100
    height: 40
    children:
      - { name: bg, type: rect, x: 0, y: 0, width: 100, height: 40 }

- def:
    name: main
    return: i32
    body:
      - return: 0
